  "title": "Sailors aboard USS Shoup qualify on M9 service pistol",
  "description": "PHILIPPINE SEA (Oct. 28, 2023) Sailors qualify on the M9 service pistol during a live-fire exercise on the flight deck aboard the Arleigh Burke-class guided-missile destroyer USS Shoup (DDG 86) while conducting routine operations in the Philippine Sea, Oct. 28. Shoup is assigned to Commander, Task Force (CTF) 70, and is forward-deployed to Yokosuka, Japan in support of a free and open Indo-Pacific. (U.S. Navy video by Mass Communication Specialist 1st Class Donavan K. Patubo)",
